 <th class="text-left p-4 font-black uppercase text-sm">Why</th>
 </tr>
 </thead>
 <tbody>
 <tr class="border-t border-slate-200">
 <td class="p-4 font-bold">Travel retail &amp; portable accessory brands</td>
 <td class="p-4 text-center"><span class="px-4 py-2 bg-green-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-full">GaN</span></td>
 <td class="p-4 text-slate-600 text-sm">One compact multi-port adapter replaces 2-3 chargers. 40% smaller packaging reduces freight cost per unit.</td>
 </tr>
 <tr class="border-t border-slate-200">
 <td class="p-4 font-bold">Multi-device consumer market (65W dual-port)</td>
 <td class="p-4 text-center"><span class="px-4 py-2 bg-green-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-full">GaN</span></td>
 <td class="p-4 text-slate-600 text-sm">Multi-port GaN handles laptop + phone from one outlet without throttling. Highest-volume OEM tier at 65W FOB $6-9/unit.</td>
