 <td class="p-4 text-center"><span class="px-4 py-2 bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-700 text-xs font-black rounded-full">Silicon OK</span></td>
 <td class="p-4 text-slate-600 text-sm">A basic 20-30W silicon charger is adequate for single-port entry SKUs. FOB $2-4/unit at volume.</td>
